Output assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "# AI-powered dependency changelog scanner"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "bun run scan -- --no-ai"
Enter
Sleep 8s

Type ""
Sleep 2s

Type "# Open web dashboard"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "bun run scan -- --dashboard --no-ai"
Enter
Sleep 6s
